# Reference frames of the main layouts (docs/archive/editor/editor-ux-redesign.md, T6):
# Mission, Script and Inspect modes at 1280x720 and 1920x1080, the
# high-contrast theme, and a 150% UI scale. The theme's contrast is linted too.
lint theme
open $RWSMAN_UI_FIXTURE/Maps/M1/M1.scn
goto actor:GUARD_GATE
compare mission-1280 3
command view.workspace.script
compare script-1280 3
command view.mode.inspect
compare inspect-1280 3
command view.workspace.mission
resize 1920x1080
compare mission-1920 3
command view.theme_high_contrast
compare mission-1920-high-contrast 3
command view.theme_dark
command view.zoom_in
command view.zoom_in
command view.zoom_in
command view.zoom_in
command view.zoom_in
compare mission-1920-150 3
